WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.012
Hi there!

2
00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:09.308
Who are you?

3
00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:12.317
I'm a clown fish.

4
00:00:12.318 --> 00:00:17.276
We are very colorful fish!

5
00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:19.692
Where do you live?

6
00:00:19.693 --> 00:00:23.694
Clown fish live in the ocean.

7
00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:26.838
We like warm water.

8
00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:31.702
We swim near rocks and reefs.

9
00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:34.305
What do you eat?

10
00:00:34.306 --> 00:00:37.876
Clown fish eat lots of plants.

11
00:00:37.877 --> 00:00:42.614
We also eat tiny animals.

12
00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:47.602
What's behind you?

13
00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:54.142
That's a sea anemone.

14
00:00:54.143 --> 00:00:57.324
Some fish are afraid of them.

15
00:00:57.325 --> 00:01:00.792
But I'm not!

16
00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.798
You like anemones?

17
00:01:04.799 --> 00:01:08.550
Yes. We help each other.

18
00:01:08.551 --> 00:01:12.388
Clown fish live with anemones.

19
00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:19.998
They protect us from enemies.

20
00:01:19.999 --> 00:01:23.638
How do clown fish help anemones?

21
00:01:23.639 --> 00:01:27.047
Clown fish clean anemones.

22
00:01:27.048 --> 00:01:30.643
We chase their enemies away.

23
00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:35.021
And we share our food.

24
00:01:35.022 --> 00:01:38.874
Do all clown fish look like you?

25
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:43.537
No. Clown fish have different colors.

26
00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:46.335
Some have different patterns.

27
00:01:46.336 --> 00:01:54.500
Look. I have three white stripes!

28
00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:58.393
Oh no! The anemone needs help.

29
00:01:58.394 --> 00:02:01.756
Good-bye!

30
00:02:01.757 --> 00:02:06.981
Good-bye, Clown Fish!

